    <string name="dev_need_perm">Some boxes hide the \"Build number\" step. To switch developer mode and USB debugging from here the launcher needs one permission. Either press the button below (needs ADB over network: on a computer run %1$s, then allow on the TV), or run on a computer:\n\n%2$s\n\nWithout it you can still open About device and tap Build number 7 times.</string>
