    <string name="ram_tap_stop">Select an app to stop its background process. System processes are listed too.</string>
    <string name="ram_need_dump">Android hides other apps\' memory from ordinary apps, so only this launcher\'s own use is shown. To see every app, turn on ADB over network once from a computer:\n\n%s\n\nThen press Refresh and choose \"Always allow\" when the TV asks about USB debugging.</string>
